#, python-brace-format
msgid "Can not convert PIL image to PMD tiled image: Palette must contain max {max_len_pal} RGB colors and be divisible by {single_palette_size}."
msgstr "无法将 PIL 图像转换为 PMD 图块图像：调色板最多包含 {max_len_pal} 种 RGB 颜色，且必须能被 {single_palette_size} 整除。"

