#: skytemple/skytemple/controller/tilequant_dialog.py:84
msgid "The maximum number of palettes that can be used. For normal backgrounds, this can be a max. of 16. For map backgrounds, both layers share in total 14 palettes (since the last 2 palettes are not rendered in game)."
msgstr "可使用的最大调色板数量。对于普通背景，最多为 16。对于地图背景，两层总共共享 14 个调色板（因为最后 2 个调色板不会在游戏中渲染）。"

#: skytemple/skytemple/controller/tilequant_dialog.py:94
msgid "This exact color of the image will be imported as transparency (default: #12ab56)."
msgstr "图像中的该颜色值将被导入为透明色（默认：#12ab56）。"

#: skytemple/skytemple/controller/tilequant_dialog.py:102
msgid "You can use this to convert multiple images at once with the same palettes. This is useful for map backgrounds with multiple layers, that need to share the same palettes."
msgstr "你可以使用此功能一次性将多张图像转换为使用相同的调色板。这对于需要共享相同调色板的多层地图背景非常有用。"

#: skytemple/skytemple/controller/tilequant_dialog.py:113
msgid "Dither: Colors will be reorganized and reduced if necessary. Colors will be changed so that they \"blend into\" each other. This will make the image look like it contains more colors but also might decrease the overall visual quality. Two different algorithms are available.\n\n"
"No Dithering: Color will be reorganized and reduced if necessary. No dithering will be performed.\n\n"
"Reorganize colors only: Colors will be reorganized so that they fit the game's format. SkyTemple will not attempt to reduce the amount of overall colors to make this work, so you will get an error, if it's not possible with the current amount. However if it does work, the output image will look identical to the original image."
msgstr "抖动：如有必要，将重组并减少颜色。颜色会被调整以使其“混合”在一起。这会让图像看起来包含更多颜色，但也可能降低整体视觉质量。有两种不同的算法可用。\n\n无抖动：如有必要，将重组并减少颜色，但不进行抖动处理。\n\n仅重组颜色：将重组颜色以符合游戏的格式。SkyTemple 不会为了使其工作而尝试减少总颜色数，因此如果当前颜色数无法满足要求，你将会收到错误。但如果成功，输出图像看起来将与原始图像完全一致。"

#: skytemple/skytemple/controller/tilequant_dialog.py:128
msgid "Only relevant if dithering is enabled: This controls the amount of dithering applied."
msgstr "仅在启用抖动时相关：控制应用的抖动量。"

#: skytemple/skytemple/controller/tilequant_dialog.py:162
