#: skytemple/skytemple/data/widget/dungeon_graphics/main.ui:238
msgid "Tileset and Background Properties:"
msgstr "图块集与背景属性："

#: skytemple/skytemple/data/widget/dungeon_graphics/tileset.ui:59
msgid "This will export all chunks. \n"
"Chunks are the 24x24px images that make up the\n"
"graphics of one dungeon tile. \n"
"The consist of 3x3 8x8px tiles.\n\n"
"You can edit and import the chunks again.\n\n"
"Please note the following about the format of the files:\n"
"- The images are 256-color indexed PNGs.\n"
"- The 256 colors are divided into 12 16 color palettes.\n"
"- Each 8x8 tile in the image MUST only use colors from\n"
"  one of these 12 palettes.\n"
"- The first color in each palette is transparency.\n\n"
"For technical reasons, the exported image will have \n"
"256 colors, only the first 12 palettes are valid.\n\n"
"Some image editors have problems when working with indexed\n"
"images, that contain the same color multiple times. You can\n"
"make all colors on the map unique before exporting at\n"
"Palettes > Edit Palettes.\n\n"
"Only if you follow these fomat restrictions, you will\n"
"be able to re-import the chunks!"
msgstr "这将导出所有块。\n块是构成一个迷宫图块图像的 24x24px 图像。\n它们由 3x3 的 8x8px 图块组成。\n\n您可以编辑并再次导入块。\n\n请注意以下有关文件格式的信息：\n- 图像为 256 色索引 PNG。\n- 256 种颜色分为 12 个 16 色调色板。\n- 图像中的每个 8x8 图块只能使用这 12 个调色板中的颜色。\n- 每个调色板中的第一种颜色是透明的。\n\n出于技术原因，导出的图像将包含 256 种颜色，但只有前 12 个调色板有效。\n\n某些图像编辑器在处理包含多次相同颜色的索引图像时会出现问题。您可以在导出前通过“调色板 > 编辑调色板”使地图上的所有颜色唯一。\n\n只有遵循这些格式限制，您才能重新导入块！"

#: skytemple/skytemple/data/widget/dungeon_graphics/tileset.ui:1229
msgid "This will export all tiles. Tiles are 8x8px images.\n"
"3x3 tiles can be grouped together to form a chunk,\n"
"see the \"Chunk Editor\" for more information.\n\n"
"You can edit and import the tiles again.\n\n"
"Please note the following about the format of the files:\n"
"- The images are 256-color indexed PNGs.\n"
"- The 256 colors are divided into 12 16 color palettes.\n"
"- Each 8x8 tile in the image MUST only use colors from\n"
"  one of these 12 palettes.\n"
"- The first color in each palette is transparency.\n"
"- All tiles are exported with using the colors of palette 0.\n\n"
"For technical reasons, the exported image will have \n"
"256 colors, only the first 12 palettes are valid.\n\n"
"Only if you follow these fomat restrictions, you will\n"
"be able to re-import the tiles!"
msgstr "这将导出所有图块。图块是 8x8px 的图像。\n3x3 的图块可组合成一个块，\n有关更多信息，请参见“块编辑器”。\n\n您可以编辑并再次导入图块。\n\n请注意以下有关文件格式的信息：\n- 图像为 256 色索引 PNG。\n- 256 种颜色分为 12 个 16 色调色板。\n- 图像中的每个 8x8 图块只能使用这 12 个调色板中的颜色。\n- 每个调色板中的第一种颜色是透明的。\n- 所有图块均使用调色板 0 的颜色导出。\n\n出于技术原因，导出的图像将包含 256 种颜色，但只有前 12 个调色板有效。\n\n只有遵循这些格式限制，您才能重新导入图块！"

#: skytemple/skytemple/data/widget/dungeon_graphics/tileset.ui:1298
msgid "Tileset X"
msgstr "图块集 X"

#: skytemple/skytemple/data/widget/dungeon_graphics/tileset.ui:1313
msgid "You can export and import the tiles from an easy-to-modify\n"
"tileset based on 47 rules (DTEF format). Additional settings\n"
"can be modified by modifying the XML in the export.\n"
"For more information about DTEF, click the \"Help\" button.\n"
"You can also manually import chunks and assign tile rules,\n"
"by switching to the Advanced Mode."
msgstr "您可以从基于 47 条规则（DTEF 格式）的易于修改的图块集中导出和导入图块。\n通过修改导出中的 XML，可以修改其他设置。\n有关 DTEF 的更多信息，请点击“帮助”按钮。\n您也可以通过切换到高级模式手动导入块并分配图块规则。"

#: skytemple/skytemple/data/widget/dungeon_graphics/tileset.ui:1485
msgid "Simple Mode (DTEF)"
msgstr "简单模式 (DTEF)"

#: skytemple/skytemple/data/widget/dungeon_graphics/tileset.ui:1707
msgid "Active Type"
msgstr "活动类型"

#: skytemple/skytemple/data/widget/dungeon_graphics/tileset.ui:1721
msgid "Wall"
msgstr "墙壁"

#: skytemple/skytemple/data/widget/dungeon_graphics/tileset.ui:1722
msgid "Water / Lava"
msgstr "水/熔岩"

#: skytemple/skytemple/data/widget/dungeon_graphics/tileset.ui:1749
msgid "Has Liquid / Wall"
msgstr "具有液体/墙壁"

#: skytemple/skytemple/data/widget/dungeon_graphics/tileset.ui:1937
msgid "Here you can edit what chunks get rendered for which dungeon field configuration. Select the configuration you want to edit, select a chunk from the \"Chunk Picker\" to use and then click on the dungeon field you want to edit.\n"
"Use the menus above to edit chunks and tile graphics.\n"
"<b>Please note</b>: The animations previewed here are not accurate to how they look in-game."
msgstr "在这里，您可以编辑何种迷宫地形配置对应渲染哪些块。选择要编辑的配置，从“块选取器”中选择要使用的块，然后点击要编辑的迷宫地形。\n使用上方的菜单编辑块和图块图像。\n<b>请注意</b>：此处预览的动画与实际游戏中的外观有所不同。"

#: skytemple/skytemple/data/widget/dungeon_graphics/tileset.ui:1997
