#: skytemple/skytemple/data/widget/dungeon_graphics/tileset.ui:2453
msgid "This will import the chunks. \n"
"The existing mappings are replaced.\n\n"
"The file is expected to have the following format:\n"
"- The images consists of 3x3 clusters (chunks) of 8x8 tiles.\n"
"- The images are indexed PNGs.\n"
"- The colors are divided into 12 16 color palettes\n"
"  (additional colors are ignored).\n"
"- Each 8x8 tile in the image MUST only use colors from\n"
"  one of these 12 palettes.\n"
"- The first color of each palette will be\n"
"  imported as transparency.\n\n"
"Colors that are in the wrong palette are replaced wth\n"
"transparency.\n\n"
"Palette animation settings are not changed."
msgstr "这将导入块。\n现有的映射将被替换。\n\n文件应具有以下格式：\n- 图像由 3x3 的 8x8 图块簇（块）组成。\n- 图像为索引 PNG。\n- 颜色被分为 12 个 16 色调色板（额外颜色将被忽略）。\n- 图像中的每个 8x8 图块只能使用这 12 个调色板中的颜色。\n- 每个调色板的第一个颜色将被导入为透明色。\n\n位于错误调色板中的颜色将被替换为透明色。\n\n调色板动画设置不会更改。"

#: skytemple/skytemple/data/widget/dungeon_graphics/tileset.ui:2630
msgid "This will import the tiles.\n\n"
"The file is expected to have the following format:\n"
"- The images consists of 8x8 tiles.\n"
"- The images are indexed PNGs.\n"
"- The colors are divided into 12 16 color palettes\n"
"  (additional colors are ignored).\n"
"- Each 8x8 tile in the image MUST only use colors from\n"
"  one of these 12 palettes.\n"
"- The first color of each palette will be\n"
"  imported as transparency."
msgstr "这将导入图块。\n\n文件应具有以下格式：\n- 图像由 8x8 的图块组成。\n- 图像为索引 PNG。\n- 颜色被分为 12 个 16 色调色板（额外颜色将被忽略）。\n- 图像中的每个 8x8 图块只能使用这 12 个调色板中的颜色。\n- 每个调色板的第一个颜色将被导入为透明色。"

