msgid "Import/Export Animated Tiles "
msgstr "导入/导出动画图块"

#: skytemple/skytemple/data/widget/map_bg/bg.ui:2690
msgid "This will export or import the selected set of animated tiles."
msgstr "这将导出或导入选定的动画图块集。"

#: skytemple/skytemple/data/widget/map_bg/bg.ui:2711
#: skytemple/skytemple/data/widget/map_bg/bg.ui:2751
msgid "Using separate images"
msgstr "使用单独图像"

#: skytemple/skytemple/data/widget/map_bg/bg.ui:2727
msgid "Exports and imports multiple images.\n\n"
"Each frame of animated tiles is a separate PNG.\n\n"
"The images are expected in the following format:\n"
"- The images consists of 8x8 tiles.\n"
"- The images are 16-color indexed PNGs.\n"
"- The first color of each palette will be\n"
"  imported as transparency.\n\n"
"When importing, all PNG files with the\n"
"name pattern \"@@@name_pattern@@@\" are imported.\n\n"
"If frames are added, the frame duration of \n"
"the last frame is copied."
msgstr "导出和导入多个图像。\n\n动画图块的每一帧都是单独的 PNG。\n\n图像应具有以下格式：\n- 图像由 8x8 的图块组成。\n- 图像为 16 色索引 PNG。\n- 每个调色板的第一个颜色将被导入为透明色。\n\n导入时，所有符合名称模式“@@@name_pattern@@@”的 PNG 文件都会被导入。\n\n如果添加了帧，最后一帧的帧持续时间将被复制。"

#: skytemple/skytemple/data/widget/map_bg/bg.ui:2783
#: skytemple/skytemple/data/widget/map_bg/bg.ui:2821
msgid "Using a single image"
msgstr "使用单张图像"

#: skytemple/skytemple/data/widget/map_bg/bg.ui:2800
msgid "Exports and imports using a single image.\n\n"
"The image is expected in the following format:\n"
"- The images consists of 8x8 tiles.\n"
"- The rows are the individual tiles.\n"
"- The columns are the frames of each tile.\n"
"- The images are 16-color indexed PNGs.\n"
"- The first color of each palette will be\n"
"  imported as transparency.\n\n"
"If frames are added, the frame duration of \n"
"the last frame is copied."
msgstr "使用单张图像进行导出和导入。\n\n图像应具有以下格式：\n- 图像由 8x8 的图块组成。\n- 行代表各个图块。\n- 列代表每个图块的各帧。\n- 图像为 16 色索引 PNG。\n- 每个调色板的第一个颜色将被导入为透明色。\n\n如果添加了帧，最后一帧的帧持续时间将被复制。"

#: skytemple/skytemple/data/widget/map_bg/bg.ui:2859
msgid "BPA to export or import:"
msgstr "要导出或导入的 BPA："

#: skytemple/skytemple/data/widget/map_bg/bg.ui:2941
