msgstr "BPA 设置"

#: skytemple/skytemple/data/widget/map_bg/bg.ui:3004
msgid "Animated Tile blocks are called BPA.\n"
"If the map has one layer:\n"
"    BPA 1-4: Layer 1\n"
"If the map has two layers:\n"
"    BPA 1-4: Layer 2     |    BPA 5-8: Layer 1"
msgstr "动画图块块称为 BPA。\n如果地图只有一个图层：\n    BPA 1-4：图层 1\n如果地图有两个图层：\n    BPA 1-4：图层 2     |    BPA 5-8：图层 1"

