#: skytemple/skytemple/data/widget/map_bg/bg.ui:5275
msgid "One of the levels assigned to this background use mode #10 or #11. The background will be rendered in game using the assigned dungeon tileset. If it's mode #10 you can build the layout above. Mode #11 uses the fixed room of the assigned floor."
msgstr "分配给此背景的关卡之一使用了模式 #10 或 #11。背景将在游戏中使用分配的迷宫图块集渲染。如果是模式 #10，您可以构建上面的布局。模式 #11 使用分配楼层的固定房间。"

#: skytemple/skytemple/data/widget/map_bg/bg.ui:5344
msgid "This background uses weird palette values for some chunks, so the game will not render this background the same as it is displayed here.\n"
"You should click on the help button get more information before continuing.\n"
"If this is intentional and you know what you are doing, you can ignore  this."
msgstr "此背景在某些块中使用了异常的调色板值，因此游戏不会按此处显示的方式渲染此背景。\n您应该在继续之前点击帮助按钮以获取更多信息。\n如果这是有意为之，并且您知道自己在做什么，则可以忽略此提示。"

#: skytemple/skytemple/data/widget/map_bg/bg.ui:5448
msgid "This will export all chunks of the selected layer.\n\n"
"You can edit and import the chunks again.\n"
"Please note, that you might need to convert it \n"
"to be able to use it. \n"
"See the import dialog for more information."
msgstr "这将导出所选图层的所有块。\n\n您可以编辑并再次导入这些块。\n请注意，您可能需要先转换它\n才能使用它。\n有关更多信息，请参见导入对话框。"

#: skytemple/skytemple/data/widget/map_bg/bg.ui:5563
msgid "This will export the entire map as one or two images,\n"
"depending on the number of layers.\n\n"
"You can edit and import the background image(s) again.\n"
"Please note, that you might need to convert it to be able\n"
"to use it. \n"
"See the import dialog for more information."
msgstr "这将根据图层数量将整个地图导出为一或两张图像。\n\n您可以编辑并再次导入背景图像。\n请注意，您可能需要先转换它\n才能使用它。\n有关更多信息，请参见导入对话框。"

#: skytemple/skytemple/data/widget/map_bg/bg.ui:5679
msgid "This will export all tiles of the selected layer.\n\n"
"You can edit and import the tiles again.\n"
"Please note, that you might need to convert it \n"
"to be able to use it. \n"
"See the import dialog for more information."
msgstr "这将导出所选图层的所有图块。\n\n您可以编辑并再次导入这些图块。\n请注意，您可能需要先转换它\n才能使用它。\n有关更多信息，请参见导入对话框。"

#: skytemple/skytemple/data/widget/map_bg/bg.ui:5844
msgid "This will import the chunks for the selected layer\n"
"using an image. The existing mappings are replaced.\n\n"
"You may need to convert the input image first,\n"
"before you can use it. See the \"Format Details\"."
msgstr "这将使用图像导入所选图层的块。\n现有的映射将被替换。\n\n您可能需要先转换输入图像，\n然后才能使用它。请参见“格式详情”。"

#: skytemple/skytemple/data/widget/map_bg/bg.ui:6072
msgid "This will import the entire map from one image\n"
"per layer.\n\n"
"You may need to convert the input image first,\n"
"before you can use it. See the \"Format Details\"."
msgstr "这将从每个图层的一张图像导入整个地图。\n\n您可能需要先转换输入图像，\n然后才能使用它。请参见“格式详情”。"

