#: skytemple/skytemple/data/widget/patch/cot.ui:41
msgid "<b>c-of-time</b> (cot) is a C runtime and development environment for writing custom patches for the game in C.\n\n"
"<b>Rust of Darkness</b> (RoD) is an extension of cot to write custom patches in Rust.\n\n"
"To get started with cot and/or RoD, watch the tutorial below and read the READMEs.\n\n"
"<b>Important</b>: Before writing cot or RoD patches to the ROM make sure to close SkyTemple. Otherwise SkyTemple may override changes you made."
msgstr "<b>c-of-time</b> (cot) 是一个 C 运行时和开发环境，用于用 C 语言编写游戏的自定义补丁。\n\n<b>Rust of Darkness</b> (RoD) 是 cot 的扩展，用于用 Rust 语言编写自定义补丁。\n\n要开始使用 cot 和/或 RoD，请观看下方教程并阅读 README 文件。\n\n<b>重要</b>：在将 cot 或 RoD 补丁写入 ROM 之前，请确保关闭 SkyTemple。否则，SkyTemple 可能会覆盖您所做的更改。"

#: skytemple/skytemple/data/widget/patch/cot.ui:128
msgid "c-of-time README"
msgstr "c-of-time README"

