#: skytemple/skytemple/module/dungeon/module.py:990
msgid "Dungeon groups contain multiple dungeon to create one big continuous dungeon.\n"
"You can edit groups under \"Dungeons\"."
msgstr "迷宫群组包含多个迷宫以创建一个大型连续迷宫。\n您可以在“迷宫”下编辑群组。"

#: skytemple/skytemple/module/dungeon/widget/dungeon.py:112
msgid "\n"
"Since this is a Dojo Dungeon, the floor count can not be changed."
msgstr "\n由于这是一个道场迷宫，因此无法更改楼层数。"

#: skytemple/skytemple/module/dungeon/widget/dungeon.py:118
#, python-brace-format
