msgstr "此迷宫有 {floor_count} 层。{edit_text}"

#: skytemple/skytemple/module/dungeon/widget/dungeon.py:202
#, python-brace-format
msgid "This dungeon currently has {current_floor_count} floors."
msgstr "此迷宫当前有 {current_floor_count} 层。"

#: skytemple/skytemple/module/dungeon/widget/dungeon.py:443
msgid "Chance of setting the random movement flag on an enemy when spawning it.\n"
"Enemies with this flag set will move randomly inside rooms, instead of heading towards one of the exits."
msgstr "敌人生成时设置随机移动标志的几率。\n设置了此标志的敌人将在房间内随机移动，而不是朝出口前进。"

#: skytemple/skytemple/module/dungeon/widget/dungeon.py:451
msgid "If enabled, enemies will evolve after defeating a team member.\n"
"The evolution will not happen if the target is revived, if the evolved form of the enemy cannot spawn in the current floor or if the sprite of the evolved form is bigger than the sprite of the enemy.\n"
"Part of this behavior can be modified by applying the BetterEnemyEvolution ASM patch."
msgstr "如果启用，敌人在击败一名队员后会进化。\n如果目标被复活、敌人的进化形态无法在当前楼层生成、或者进化形态的精灵比敌人的精灵大，则不会进化。\n通过应用 BetterEnemyEvolution ASM 补丁可以修改此行为的部分内容。"

#: skytemple/skytemple/module/dungeon/widget/fixed.py:570
msgid "Width and height must be numbers >= 0."
msgstr "宽度和高度必须是大于等于 0 的数字。"

#: skytemple/skytemple/module/dungeon/widget/fixed.py:571
msgid "Invalid values."
msgstr "无效值。"

#: skytemple/skytemple/module/dungeon/widget/fixed.py:582
msgid "You are about to reduce the size of the room. This will delete tiles. Do you want to continue?"
msgstr "您将要减小房间的大小。这将删除图块。您要继续吗？"

#: skytemple/skytemple/module/dungeon/widget/fixed.py:596
msgid "If not set, the track ID specified on the floor this fixed floor is assigned to will be used instead."
msgstr "如果未设置，将使用分配此固定房间的楼层上指定的音轨 ID。"

#: skytemple/skytemple/module/dungeon/widget/fixed.py:603
msgid "Whether or not moves can be used. Does not affect the regular attack. If 0, other Pokémon will not attack (they won't even use the regular attack, not even if Exclusive Move-User is disabled)"
msgstr "是否可以使用招式。不影响普通攻击。如果为 0，其他宝可梦将不会攻击（即使禁用了“独占招式使用者”，它们甚至不会使用普通攻击）。"

#: skytemple/skytemple/module/dungeon/widget/fixed.py:611
msgid "If ChangeFixedFloorProperties is not applied and the fixed floor ID is 0 or >= 165 this setting is ignored. Orbs are always allowed."
msgstr "如果未应用 ChangeFixedFloorProperties 且固定房间 ID 为 0 或 >= 165，则此设置将被忽略。宝珠始终被允许。"

#: skytemple/skytemple/module/dungeon/widget/fixed.py:617
msgid "If enabled, the floor is exited after all the enemies have been defeated"
msgstr "如果启用，击败所有敌人后将离开楼层。"

#: skytemple/skytemple/module/dungeon/widget/fixed.py:623
msgid "If disabled, certain traps (Summon, Pitfall and Pokémon) will be disabled.\n"
"If ChangeFixedFloorProperties is not applied and the fixed floor ID is 0 or >= 165 this setting is ignored. It is always enabled."
msgstr "如果禁用，某些陷阱（召唤、落穴和宝可梦）将被禁用。\n如果未应用 ChangeFixedFloorProperties 且固定房间 ID 为 0 或 >= 165，则此设置将被忽略。它始终启用。"

#: skytemple/skytemple/module/dungeon/widget/fixed.py:631
msgid "If disabled, warping, being blown away and leaping effects will be disabled.\n"
"If ChangeFixedFloorProperties is not applied and the fixed floor ID is 0 or >= 165 this setting is ignored. It is always enabled."
msgstr "如果禁用，传送、被吹飞和跳跃效果将被禁用。\n如果未应用 ChangeFixedFloorProperties 且固定房间 ID 为 0 或 >= 165，则此设置将被忽略。它始终启用。"

#: skytemple/skytemple/module/dungeon/widget/fixed.py:639
msgid "If disabled, prevents any kind of item pulling (such as with the Trawl Orb).\n"
"If ChangeFixedFloorProperties is not applied and the fixed floor ID is 0 or >= 165 this setting is ignored. It is always enabled."
msgstr "如果禁用，将阻止任何形式的道具拉取（例如使用拖网宝珠）。\n如果未应用 ChangeFixedFloorProperties 且固定房间 ID 为 0 或 >= 165，则此设置将被忽略。它始终启用。"

#: skytemple/skytemple/module/dungeon/widget/fixed.py:647
msgid "If enabled, the game will treat this fixed room as an entire floor, not a single room in a floor layout.\n"
"If ChangeFixedFloorProperties is not applied, this will only be enabled when the fixed floor ID is between 1 and 164. "
msgstr "如果启用，游戏将把此固定房间视为整个楼层，而不是楼层布局中的一个房间。\n如果未应用 ChangeFixedFloorProperties，则仅当固定房间 ID 介于 1 到 164 之间时才会启用此功能。"

#: skytemple/skytemple/module/dungeon/widget/fixed.py:655
msgid "Enables boss fight conditions.\n"
"If ChangeFixedFloorProperties is not applied, this will only be enabled when the fixed floor ID is between 1 and 80. "
msgstr "启用头目战条件。\n如果未应用 ChangeFixedFloorProperties，则仅当固定房间 ID 介于 1 到 80 之间时才会启用此功能。"

#: skytemple/skytemple/module/dungeon/widget/fixed.py:663
msgid "Allows free layouts. For example, fixed rooms with this setting can omit stairs.\n"
"If ChangeFixedFloorProperties is not applied, this will only be enabled when the fixed floor ID is between 1 and 110. "
msgstr "允许自由布局。例如，启用此设置的固定房间可以省略楼梯。\n如果未应用 ChangeFixedFloorProperties，则仅当固定房间 ID 介于 1 到 110 之间时才会启用此功能。"

#: skytemple/skytemple/module/dungeon/widget/fixed.py:671
msgid "If the dungeon mode is REQUEST (= the dungeon is marked as cleared once), this fixed floor will be used instead.\n"
"This is used in dungeons where the content of a fixed floor varies depending on the story progress, such as in most of the dungeons with a legendary Pokémon at the end (first visit vs rematch)."
msgstr "如果迷宫模式为 REQUEST（即迷宫被标记为已通关一次），则将使用此固定房间。\n这用于固定房间内容根据剧情进度而变化的迷宫，例如大多数最终有传说宝可梦的迷宫（首次访问与再战）。"

