#: skytemple/skytemple/module/dungeon/widget/floor.py:543
msgid "This attribute is the base rank of this floor. \n"
"The floor rank determines the item list used for mission rewards and treasure boxes content. \n"
"Needs the 'ExtractDungeonData' patch to be applied to edit this attribute."
msgstr "此属性是此楼层的基础等级。\n楼层等级决定了用于任务奖励和宝箱内容的道具列表。\n需要应用“ExtractDungeonData”补丁才能编辑此属性。"

#: skytemple/skytemple/module/dungeon/widget/floor.py:562
msgid "If this attribute is set to 'Yes', no missions will be generated for this floor, and Wonder Mail S codes targetting this floor will be considered as invalid. \n"
"Needs the 'ExtractDungeonData' patch to be applied to edit this attribute."
msgstr "如果此属性设置为“是”，则不会为此楼层生成任何任务，并且以此楼层为目标的不可思议邮件 S 代码将被视为无效。\n需要应用“ExtractDungeonData”补丁才能编辑此属性。"

#: skytemple/skytemple/module/dungeon/widget/floor.py:601
msgid "The game randomly adds a number between 0 and 2 to obtain the final value. If the room density is negative, its absolute value is used without adding a random variation."
msgstr "游戏会随机添加一个 0 到 2 之间的数字以获得最终值。如果房间密度为负，则使用其绝对值，不添加随机变化。"

#: skytemple/skytemple/module/dungeon/widget/floor.py:619
msgid "Controls whether dead end hallways can be generated in the floor. Dead ends can still appear in the map even if they are disabled due to a bug in the map generator and because extra hallways can also produce them."
msgstr "控制楼层中是否可以生成死胡同走廊。即使禁用了死胡同，由于地图生成器中的错误以及额外走廊也可能产生死胡同，它们仍可能出现在地图中。"

#: skytemple/skytemple/module/dungeon/widget/floor.py:649
msgid "This is the amount of lakes that will be generated during the water generation phase."
msgstr "这是在水域生成阶段将生成的湖泊数量。"

#: skytemple/skytemple/module/dungeon/widget/floor.py:667
msgid "Floor connectivity (Min 1, if it's 0 a valid map can't be generated and you will get the default single room that it's also a monster house).\n\n"
"This is the amount of connections between cells that will be generated when the map is first created. More will be added later to ensure that all the rooms can be accessed.\n"
"A cell is a point in the initial grid used to generate the map. It will end up being a room or a crossroad once the full map is generated."
msgstr "楼层连通性（最小值为 1，如果为 0，则无法生成有效地图，您将获得默认的单房间，该房间同时也是怪兽屋）。\n\n这是首次创建地图时将在单元格之间生成的连接数量。之后会添加更多连接以确保所有房间都可通行。\n单元格是用于生成地图的初始网格中的一个点。完整地图生成后，它将最终成为一个房间或一个十字路口。"

#: skytemple/skytemple/module/dungeon/widget/floor.py:675
msgid "Used to generate additional hallways in the map (those \"donuts\" that lead to nowhere, multiple entrances to the same room, room exits connected to the same room, those dead ends that come out of a room, make a couple of twists and also lead to nowhere)"
msgstr "用于在地图中生成额外的走廊（那些不通向任何地方的“环形路”、通往同一房间的多个入口、连接到同一房间的房间出口、从房间出来绕了几圈也通向死胡同的死胡同）。"

#: skytemple/skytemple/module/dungeon/widget/floor.py:772
msgid "The final value is randomized between density and density/2."
msgstr "最终值在密度和密度/2之间随机化。"

#: skytemple/skytemple/module/dungeon/widget/floor.py:776
msgid "The final value is randomized between density - 2 and density + 1."
msgstr "最终值在密度 - 2 和密度 + 1 之间随机化。"

#: skytemple/skytemple/module/dungeon/widget/floor.py:782
msgid "The final value is randomized between density / 2 and density - 1. If the value is negative and the NegativeEnemyDensity patch is applied, the absolute value of the density is used instead (no random variation is applied in this case). If the value is 0, no enemies will spawn on the floor, even as turns pass."
msgstr "最终值在密度/2和密度-1之间随机化。如果值为负数且应用了 NegativeEnemyDensity 补丁，则将使用密度的绝对值（在这种情况下不应用随机变化）。如果值为 0，即使经过回合，也不会有敌人生成。"

#: skytemple/skytemple/module/dungeon/widget/floor.py:790
msgid "The value stored in the ROM is actually what you write here divided by 5. Because of this, your input will be rounded to the next multiple of 5."
msgstr "ROM 中存储的值实际上是您在此处写入的值除以 5。因此，您的输入将四舍五入为 5 的下一个倍数。"

#: skytemple/skytemple/module/dungeon/widget/floor.py:796
msgid "These sliders control how likely it is (in %) for certain things to generate on this floor."
msgstr "这些滑块控制此楼层上生成特定事物的可能性（以百分比表示）。"

#: skytemple/skytemple/module/dungeon/widget/floor.py:802
msgid "Every Kecleon shop has a minimum amount of guaranteed items.\n"
"This value controls where in the shop they will be placed."
msgstr "每个变隐龙商店都有最低数量的保证道具。\n此值控制它们将放置在商店中的位置。"

#: skytemple/skytemple/module/dungeon/widget/floor.py:810
#, python-format
msgid "0 --> 100% secret bazaar\n"
"1 --> 100% secret room\n"
"255 --> 50% secret bazaar, 50% secret room\n"
"Other values: 0% secret bazaar, 0% secret room (you just go to the next floor like normal stairs)."
msgstr "0 --> 100% 秘密集市\n1 --> 100% 秘密房间\n255 --> 50% 秘密集市, 50% 秘密房间\n其他值：0% 秘密集市, 0% 秘密房间（您就像普通楼梯一样前往下一层）。"

#: skytemple/skytemple/module/dungeon/widget/floor.py:833
msgid "Does not work in the game. To make it work, apply the \"UnusedDungeonChance\" from \"Patches\" > \"ASM\".\n"
"If patched, the game will turn a random room into a maze room made of wall tiles instead of the usual water (although water can later replace some of the walls once the water generation takes place)."
msgstr "在游戏中不起作用。要使其生效，请从“补丁”>“ASM”中应用“UnusedDungeonChance”。\n如果应用了补丁，游戏会将随机房间变成由墙壁图块组成的迷宫房间，而不是通常的水域（尽管水域生成后，水域可能会取代部分墙壁）。"

#: skytemple/skytemple/module/dungeon/widget/floor.py:863
msgid "It was added in explorers of sky, so right now it's only used in the sky exclusive dungeons.\n"
"If a monster house spawns in the floor, this is the chance of it being empty (no items will be generated inside)."
msgstr "它是在《空之探险队》中添加的，因此目前仅在天空专属迷宫中可用。\n如果楼层中生成了怪兽屋，这是它为空（内部不会生成任何道具）的几率。"

#: skytemple/skytemple/module/dungeon/widget/floor.py:898
msgid "If more than 0, the IQ booster increases IQ on this floor by this amount."
msgstr "如果大于 0，IQ 增强剂会在此楼层上将 IQ 提高此数值。"

#: skytemple/skytemple/module/dungeon/widget/floor.py:949
msgid "You can not spawn Kecleons or the Decoy Pokémon."
msgstr "您不能生成变隐龙或诱饵宝可梦。"

