#: skytemple/skytemple/module/dungeon/widget/floor.py:1690
msgid "Change the chances of Pokémon, traps or items spawning.\n"
"The spawn chance depends on the weight of an entry. The higher an entry's weight is, the more likely it is to spawn.\n"
"Please note for Pokémon, that weights for Pokémon that can not be spawned (eg. legendaries without having their items) will be added to the next Pokémon entry in the list when the game decides what to spawn.\n"
"Please note for items, that the game first decides what category to spawn for an item and then chooses an entry for that category.\n"
"All spawn entries are always saved to the game sorted by their (Pokémon, item, trap) ID."
msgstr "更改宝可梦、陷阱或道具的生成几率。\n生成几率取决于条目的权重。条目的权重越高，生成的可能性越大。\n关于宝可梦，请注意，当游戏决定生成什么时，无法生成的宝可梦（例如没有其专属道具的传说宝可梦）的权重将被添加到列表中的下一个宝可梦条目。\n关于道具，请注意，游戏首先决定为道具生成哪个类别，然后为该类别选择一个条目。\n所有生成条目始终按（宝可梦、道具、陷阱）ID 排序保存到游戏中。"

#: skytemple/skytemple/module/dungeon/widget/floor.py:1694
msgid "If 'Use same spawn weights for Monster Houses' is checked, the same spawn weights are used for regular spawns and spawns in Monster Houses.\n"
"If it is not checked, you can edit these weights separately."
msgstr "如果选中了“对怪兽屋使用相同的生成权重”，则常规生成和怪兽屋中的生成将使用相同的生成权重。\n如果未选中，您可以分别编辑这些权重。"

