msgid "Can Throw Items?"
msgstr "可投掷道具？"

#: skytemple/skytemple/module/monster/widget/monster.py:778
msgid "Controls the drop rates of different types of chests.\n"
"Each drop type x has a chance of (x rate)/(sum of all the rates) to be selected."
msgstr "控制不同类型宝箱的掉落率。\n每种掉落类型 x 有 (x 的概率)/(所有概率之和) 的机会被选中。"

