#: skytemple/skytemple/module/tiled_img/widget/palette_editor.py:114
msgid "Some images editors have problems when editing indexed images that contain\n"
"the same color multiple times (they mis-match the actual color index).\n"
"Since the import expects all 8x8 tiles to only use one 16-color palette, this\n"
"can lead to issues.\n\n"
"To solve this, you can make all colors in the palettes unique. This is done by\n"
"slightly shifting the color values of duplicate colors (not visible for the\n"
"human eye)."
msgstr "某些图像编辑器在编辑包含多次相同颜色的索引图像时会遇到问题（它们会错误匹配实际的颜色索引）。\n由于导入要求所有 8x8 图块只能使用一个 16 色调色板，因此这可能会导致问题。\n\n要解决此问题，您可以使调色板中的所有颜色唯一。这是通过\n略微移动重复颜色的颜色值来实现的（人眼无法察觉）。"

#: skytemple/skytemple/module/tiled_img/widget/palette_editor.py:122
msgid "Make Colors Unique"
msgstr "使颜色唯一"

#: skytemple/skytemple/module/tiled_img/widget/palette_editor.py:137
msgid "Made colors unique."
msgstr "颜色已变得唯一。"

#: skytemple/skytemple/module/tiled_img/widget/palette_editor.py:170
msgid "You can not remove the last palette."
msgstr "您无法移除最后一个调色板。"

#: skytemple/skytemple/module/tiled_img/widget/palette_editor.py:226
msgid "Color "
msgstr "颜色"

#: skytemple/skytemple/skytemple.glade:47
msgid "<span size=\"large\">Welcome to SkyTemple!</span>\n\n"
"With this tool you can edit various things in ROMs\n"
"of Pokémon Mystery Dungeon Explorers of Sky.\n\n"
"You can find more information on how to use this\n"
"application in <a href=\"wiki\">the SkyTemple wiki</a>.\n"
"You can also access help from the wiki for\n"
"the section you are currently in with the \"?\"\n"
"icon at the top of the app."
msgstr "<span size=\"large\">欢迎使用 SkyTemple！</span>\n\n使用此工具，您可以编辑《宝可梦不可思议迷宫 空之探险队》\nROM 中的各种内容。\n\n您可以在<a href=\"wiki\">SkyTemple 维基</a>中找到有关如何使用此应用程序的更多信息。\n您也可以使用应用程序顶部的“?”图标\n从维基访问当前所在部分的帮助。"

#: skytemple/skytemple/skytemple.glade:103
msgid "Can we add a \"Created with SkyTemple\" message\n"
" to the logos, that appear when starting the game?\n\n"
"This message will be placed on Layer 2 of map\n"
"background S05P01A. If you don't like it, you can\n"
"easily remove it or customize it.\n\n"
"If you want to do it later, or for another project,\n"
"you can reopen this dialog, using the menu on\n"
"the top-right of the main window."
msgstr "我们能否在启动游戏时出现的徽标上添加\n“使用 SkyTemple 创建”的消息？\n\n此消息将放置在地图背景 S05P01A 的第 2 层。\n如果您不喜欢，可以轻松删除或自定义它。\n\n如果您想稍后再做，或为其他项目添加，\n您可以使用主窗口右上角的菜单重新打开此对话框。"

